# =============================================================================
# 后端镜像构建上下文排除清单（构建上下文 = backend/，见 deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml）
# 镜像只需要 requirements*.txt / app/ / alembic/ / alembic.ini，
# 其余全部挡在上下文外：省带宽与磁盘，也确保 .env 之类的凭据永远不会被 COPY 进层。
# =============================================================================

# --- 本地虚拟环境与缓存 ---
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.tox
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov
coverage.xml
.benchmarks

# --- 大体积 / 非运行时代码 ---
uploads
logs
*.log
tests
seed
scripts
docs
migrations
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite
*.dump

# --- 机密与本地产物：绝不进镜像 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.crt

# --- 仓库元数据 / 本地配置 ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
*.md
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
.dockerignore.*
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
